> dlog 3 base 2 mod 11
2^x = 3 in Z/11: x = 8 (mod 10, the order of 2)
  how: Pohlig-Hellman over 10 = 2 * 5, baby-step giant-step for each prime
  check: 2^8 = 3
> dlog 5 base 2 mod 1000003
2^x = 5 in Z/1000003: x = 292379 (mod 1000002, the order of 2)
  how: Pohlig-Hellman over 1000002 = 2 * 3 * 166667, baby-step giant-step for each prime
  check: 2^292379 = 5
> dlog 1 base 7 mod 13
7^x = 1 in Z/13: x = 0 (mod 12, the order of 7)
  how: Pohlig-Hellman over 12 = 2^2 * 3, baby-step giant-step for each prime
  check: 7^0 = 1
> dlog 8 base 2 mod 101
2^x = 8 in Z/101: x = 3 (mod 100, the order of 2)
  how: Pohlig-Hellman over 100 = 2^2 * 5^2, baby-step giant-step for each prime
  check: 2^3 = 8
> dlog 6 base 3 mod 97
3^x = 6 in Z/97: x = 44 (mod 48, the order of 3)
  how: Pohlig-Hellman over 48 = 2^4 * 3, baby-step giant-step for each prime
  check: 3^44 = 6
